<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rom</book>
  <para style="h">Romukailu Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc1">Romukailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM</para>
  <para style="mt1">Romukailu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli ka Alla la Kuma Mɛn Nawa Romukailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">San dɔndɔ tamin kɔrɔ Isa la saya ni a la wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, Judiya lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase damira Romi so kɔndɔ, mansa so. Wo le rɔ, sani Pɔli ye kawandili kɛ waati mɛn na Siriya ni Asi ni Kirɛki jamanailu rɔ, lemɛniya jama tɛrɛ ye Romi so kɔndɔ. Alla ka a fɔ Pɔli yɛ ko a ye wa haan dunuɲa dan, a tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka wa Romi so ni Esipaɲa jamana le rɔ yɔrɔ mɛnilu ye Romi so kɔfɛ pon! A ka Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin sɛbɛ Romi so lemɛniya mɔɔilu le ma a la taama kanma mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye ii ladɛnna Pirisili ni Akila wara. A tɛrɛ ye a fɛ le, woilu ye a dɛmɛn a la taama rɔ, ka fen doilu di a ma kosa a ye wa se wo yɔrɔ jan dɔ, lemɛniya jama tɛrɛ ma masɔrɔn yɔrɔ mɛn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli tɛrɛ ye karanna le Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin dɔ ka a yiraka ye lemɛniya mɔɔilu la ale ye a la keladenbaya lakanbalila ɲa mɛn ma siya gbɛrɛilu tɛma. Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ye Pɔli la kawandili ɲa le ɲafɔla ka tamin Kitabu yɔrɔ gbɛrɛilu la a ka mɛnilu sɛbɛ kosa ye mɔɔilu ye sɔn a dɛmɛn ko rɔ. Ale jɛrɛ ra a la kawandili kuma lasudunya ten ko, «N ma maloya Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lasela, baa Alla fanka le a ri kosa mɔɔ si wa la a la, wo ye kisi, ka damira Judiyailu ma ka wa siya gbɛrɛilu ma.» (Romukailu suran 1 kuma diya 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Talibidenba Pɔli la waati rɔ, masɔsɔli siyaman tɛrɛ ye Judiyailu ni siya gbɛrɛilu lemɛniya mɔɔilu tɛma. A gbengben, siya gbɛrɛ mɔɔilu wa kɛ lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri, ni a tɛrɛ ri bɛn woilu ye Judiyailu la sariya mira wala ii kana a mira. Wo tɛrɛ kɛnin masɔsɔli ba le ri haan a la ko fɔra Pɔli la kitabu siyaman dɔ. Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin dɔ, Pɔli ye a fɔla ko a ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma mɛn nasela, wo siyailu bɛɛ le ta le (Romukailu suran 1 kuma diya 16). A ye a ɲafɔla fanan Alla ye hakɛtiilu lakisila ɲa mɛn ma, a kɛra mɔɔ mɔɔ ri, mɛn lemɛniyanin Isa ma (Romukailu suran 1 kuma diya 18 haan suran 8 kuma diya 39).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka a fɔ Alla la kuma ye lakanbalila ɲa mɛn ma Judiyailu la ko la hali Judiya mɔɔ doilu ra ii ban Isa jatela Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. A ye fɔla ko wo kɔnɔrɔjuuya ti se Alla la kuma tiɲanna, baa tɔ la, a la sɔli ri se woilu fanan ma (Ka bɔ Romukailu suran 9 ma haan 11). Wo kɔndɔ, Alla ra hina siya gbɛrɛilu fanan na sani Judiyailu ye ii kɔsɛ a ma waati mɛn na kosa Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma ye siyaya siya gbɛrɛilu rɔ, ka dunuɲaratɛɛ sɛniman kɛ. (Ka bɔ Romukailu suran 12 kuma diya 1 ma haan suran 15 kuma diya 13).</para>
  <para style="ip">A laban, Pɔli ye a fɔla ii yɛ ko a ye a fɛ ka wa Romi so ni Esipaɲa jamana rɔ kosa a ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ye mɔɔilu fanan ma. A ka Romukailu tuwa (suran 15 kuma diya 14 haan suran 16 kuma diya 27). Mɛnilu bɛɛ ye a fɛ ka a lɔn ko Alla ye mɔɔilu lakisila ɲa mɛn ma, Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ye ii dɛmɛnna le wo la.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli ye Kibaro Ɲuma mɛn nasela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nde Pɔli, Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la baaraden, Alla ra mɛn kili kosa n ye kɛ a la talibidenba ri, a ka n bila n dan na kosa n ye Alla la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma lase, n da ɲin sɛbɛ ai ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Alla ka jama lahidi Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma ɲin de la ka fara nabiya kumailu la Kitabu Sɛnimanilu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />A dencɛ la ko le tɛrɛ a ri, mɛn sɔrɔnnin Dawuda bɔnsɔn dɔ faribanku rɔ, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Nii Sɛniman ka a yiraka sebaya rɔ ko Alla Dencɛ le a ri, baa an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin da wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Alla ra an kɛ talibidenbailu ri a la hina rɔ Isa tɔɔ kosɔn kosa siyailu bɛɛ ye a kan mira lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Aile fanan ye wo mɔɔilu tɛma, Alla ka mɛnilu kili ka a kɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta ri.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Awa, mɛnilu bɛɛ ye Romu, Alla kaninteilu, a ka mɛnilu kili fanan, ka kɛ a la jama sɛniman di, n da ɲin sɛbɛ ai bɛɛ ma. An Fa Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla matara ni baraka bila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />N ye baraka le fɔlɔ bilala Alla yɛ ai bɛɛ la ko rɔ, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔilu ye ai la lemɛniya la ko fɔla dunuɲa yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Alla le n sere ri, n ye mɛn batola a Dencɛ la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ko rɔ n jusu bɛɛ rɔ. A ka a lɔn ko n miriya ye ai ko waati bɛɛ <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />n wa kɛ Alla matarala waati si. Sinɛn, n ye Alla matarala, ni a sawo le, a ye fɛrɛ di n ma ka wa ai wara. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ka a masɔrɔn ai yen lɔɔ ye n na kosɛbɛ, kosa Alla la Nii Sɛniman da ko sɛniman mɛn di n ma, n ye wo do latamin ai ma, ai ye fanka sɔrɔn <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />kosa an ye an ɲɔɔn fanka don an na lemɛniya rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ ai ye a lɔn, n tɛrɛ ra karan siɲa siyaman, ka wa ai fo kɔni n ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn. N tɛrɛ ye a fɛ, ka lɛmeniya mɔɔ doilu sɔrɔn ai wara ikomin n ka a sɔrɔn siya gbɛrɛilu tɛma ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />N ka kan ka wa Kirɛkiilu ni siya doilu ma, hankilimailu ni hankilidɔɔilu. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Wo le rɔ, a lɔɔ ye n na haan, ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai le Romukailu fanan ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma fanka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />N tɛ maloyala Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la, baa Alla la sebaya le wo ri kosa mɔɔ si wa la a la, wo ri kisi, ka damira Judiyailu ma ka wa se siya gbɛrɛilu ma. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma ra telenbaya yiraka, Alla ye mɛn dila mɔɔilu ma. Wo damiranin lemɛniya le ma ka laban lemɛniya ma, ikomin a sɛbɛnin ɲa mɛn ma Kitabu rɔ ko, «Mɔɔ telennin di a la dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛ landaɲa rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.17</char> Habakuki suran 2 kuma diya 4</note><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu jalaki ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Alla ye a la mɔnɛ yirakala ka bɔ harijeene rɔ, mɔɔilu la Alla lɔnbaliya ni ii la telenbaliya bɛɛ kanma, mɛnilu ye tuɲa dokonna ii la telenbaliya fɛ, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />baa mɔɔilu ri se mɛn lɔnna Alla la ko rɔ, wo ra lagbɛ ii ma, baa Alla ra a lagbɛ ii ma. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Baa kɛbi dunuɲa danda, Alla kɛɲa mɛnilu tɛrɛ tɛ yenna ɲa la, mɛn ye a la habadan fanka ni a la Allaya ri, woilu ye ragbɛla kosɛbɛ, baa mɔɔilu ye ii famunna a la dalifen fɛ. Wo le rɔ, ii ti se ii jɛrɛ kun makala. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Hali ii ra Alla lɔn, ii ma a gbiliya ikomin Alla, wala ka baraka bila a yɛ. Kɔni ii ra kɛ fuu ii la miriyailu rɔ. Ii jusu hankilitanilu ra ii bila dibi rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ii ra ii jɛrɛ jate hankilimailu ri, kɔni ii ra kɛ kɔmɔɔilu ri. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Ii ra Alla ɲenema la gbiliya falen jooilu la mɛnilu ladannin mɔɔilu ni kɔnɔilu ni soboilu ni gbankanbandɔilu munuɲa la.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Wo le rɔ, Alla ra ii labila ii la kɔsɔ koilu rɔ ii jusuilu kunfannin mɛnilu fɛ, ka to ii ɲɔɔn fari lafɛyala. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ii ra Alla la tuɲa falen wuya la, ka baara dalifenilu yɛ, ka ii bato, sani ii ye Dannin Maari bato, baraka ye mɛn yɛ haan habadan. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Wo koilu rɔ, Alla ra ii labila ii la malobaliya kunfan koilu rɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn hali ii musoilu fanan da ii ban ii dan ɲa rɔ, ka laɲɔɔya ɲɔɔn gbɛrɛilu kɛ mɛnilu tɛ ii dan ɲa rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Cɛɛilu fanan ye wo ɲa le ma, ka ii ban musoilu la laɲɔɔya ma, ka ii ɲɔɔn nakunfan. Cɛɛ ni cɛɛ ye ii ɲɔɔn namaloya ka laɲɔɔya kɛ, ka ii la kojuu sara sɔrɔn.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Fanan ii ra ii ban Alla lɔnna, a ra ii labila ii la hankili dɔɔya rɔ, ka to ko dahabaliilu kɛla, mɛn ma kan ka kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ii fanin telenbaliya ni kojuu ni wasabaliya ni juuya su bɛɛ la. Ii fanin keleya ni mɔɔ faa ko ni bɛnbaliya ni janfanteya ni lagboyaɲɛ la. Ii ra kɛ mɔɔ mafɔlailu ri, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />a ni mɔɔ tɔɔ tiɲanninnailu ni Alla juuilu ni mɔɔ fankɔrɔtanninilu ni wasolailu ni jɛrɛdabailu ri, ii ye kojuu kewuya kurailu labɔla, ii ti ii sɔrɔnbailu kumakan bonyala. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Hankilidɔɔilu ni landaɲabaliilu ni jusutanilu ni kininkininbaliilu le ii ri. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Hali, ii ka Alla la sariya telennin lɔn, ko mɔɔ mɛnilu ye ko ɲinilu kɛla, woilu ka kan de ka faa, ii tɛ wo koilu le dɔrɔn kɛla, kɔni a duman ii yɛ fanan ko mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu fanan ye woilu kɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Alla la kiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />I kɛra mɔɔ mɔɔ ri, ile mɛn ye doilu jalakila, i ti se i jɛrɛ kun makala. Ka a masɔrɔn i ye doilu jalakila ko mɛnilu la, ile fanan jɛrɛ ye woilu kɛla. Wo rɔ, i ra i jɛrɛ fanan jalaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />An ka a lɔn ko Alla ye kiti tɛɛla telen de rɔ mɔɔilu yɛ tuɲa la, mɛnilu ye ko su ɲinilu kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Kɔni i wa kɛ mɔɔ mɔɔ ri, i lanin a la wa ko ile ri bɔ Alla la kiti kɔrɔ wa, ile mɛn ye doilu jalakila koilu rɔ ile jɛrɛ ye mɛnilu kɛla? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Wala i yonin Alla la ɲumaya le ma wa, a ni a la diɲɛ ni a la muɲun? I ma a lɔn ko Alla la ɲumaya ka kan de ka i latuntun tubi ma wa? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Kɔni i la tengberenya ni i la jusu tubibali la ko kosɔn, i ye tola Alla la mɔnɛ makafula mɛn namaranin i kanma, a ri i sɔrɔn Alla la mɔnɛ lon dɔ, Alla la kiti telennin wa bɔ kɛnɛma waati mɛn na. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Alla ri mɔɔ bɛɛ sara a kɛwaliilu la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.6</char> A ragbɛ Yaburi suran 62 kuma diya 13 a ni Sandailu suran 24 kuma diya 12 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />A ri ɲenemaya banbali di mɔɔilu ma mɛnilu ye gbiliya ni kunnafulen ni sayabaliya ɲininna, ka ii tunadiya ko ɲuma rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Kɔni a la duɲa ni a la mɔnɛ ri wuli mɔɔilu kanma mɛnilu ye ii jɛrɛmakaranna, ka ii ban tuɲa ma, ka bila telenbaliya kɔfɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Awa, tɔrɔya ni kɔndafiliilu ri la kojuu kɛlailu bɛɛ kan, ka damira Judiyailu ma ka wa siya gbɛrɛilu ma. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Kɔni Alla ri gbiliya ni kunnafulen ni jususuma di koɲuma kɛlailu bɛɛ ma, ka damira Judiyailu ma ka wa siya gbɛrɛilu ma. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ka a masɔrɔn Alla tɛ mɔɔilu lafisayala ii ɲɔɔn ko.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Mɛnilu bɛɛ ye julumun kɛla, ni ii tɛ Musa la sariya kɔrɔ, woilu ri halaki hali ka bɔ wo sariya ma. Kɔni mɛnilu bɛɛ ye hakɛ kɛla Musa la sariya kɔrɔ, sariya ri woilu makiti. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ka a masɔrɔn mɛnilu wa ii tolo malɔ sariya la gbansan, woilu telennin tɛ Alla ɲakɔrɔ, kɔni mɛnilu wa sariya mira, Alla ri woilu jate mɔɔ telennin di. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Baa, siya gbɛrɛ mɛnilu ma Musa la sariya lɔn woilu wa koilu kɛ mɛn dahanin sariya ma ii la mɔɔya fɛ, hali Musa la sariya tɛrɛ tɛ ii bolo, woilu ra ii ta sariya labɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Wo ye a yirakala le ko sariya ka jamarili mɛn di, wo sɛbɛnin tɛrɛ ii jusu le rɔ. Ii jɛrɛ hankili le ii sereya ri, a ni ii la miriya firifirinin de tɔɔ lala ii la, wala ka ii kun makɛlɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />A ye kɛla wo ɲa le ma Alla wa bɔ mɔɔilu la gbundu koilu makiti diya lon mɛn na Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ, ikomin n ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma mɛn nasela, wo ye a fɔla ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judiyailu ni sariya la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Kɔni ni ile ye a fɔla ko Judiya le i ri, i bolo malanin sariya ma, ka to wasola Alla la, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ka a sawo lɔn, ka sɔn ko fisamantɛ ma, baa i ra kolo sariya bolo, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />a ni, ni i lanin a la ko ɲa funyen bolo mirala le ile ri, a ni kɛnɛya mɛn ye mɔɔilu dɛmɛnna dibi rɔ, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />mɛn ye hankilidɔɔilu karanna a ni denninilu karanmɔɔ, baa i lanin a la ko i ra lɔnnin ni tuɲa jɛrɛjɛrɛ sɔrɔn sariya rɔ, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />wo rɔ, ile mɛn ye doilu karanna, i ye i jɛrɛ karanna le wa? Ile mɛn ye kawandili kɛla ko mɔɔ kana suɲali kɛ, ile ye suɲali kɛla wa? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ile mɛn ye tɔn siila kaninkɛ la, ile ye kaninkɛ kɛla wa? Jooilu gboman ile mɛn yɛ, i ye ii batobonilu kɔndɔ fenilu suɲala le wa? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />I ye i tola i wasola sariya la, kɔni i ye Alla lamaloyala sariya tiɲan na! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ka a masɔrɔn, a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ko, «Alla tɔɔ ye lafɛyala siya gbɛrɛilu bolo aile le la ko kosɔn.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.24</char> Esayi suran 52 kuma diya 5</note><verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Judiyailu la faaninta, tɔnɔ ye a la, ni i ka sariya mira. Kɔni ni sariya tiɲanna le i ri, hali i ra faaninta kɛ, i jatenin de sinɛn ikomin faanintabali. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Wo rɔ, ni siya gbɛrɛ mɛn ma faaninta kɛ, ka sariya mira, Alla tɛ wo jate ikomin a ra faaninta kɛ wa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ni faanintabali ka Alla la sariya mira, a tɛ ile Judiya jalaki? Ka a masɔrɔn i ye sariya tiɲanna, hali a sɛbɛnin tɛrɛ i bolo mɛn da faaninta kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Judiya dina munuɲa ye mɔɔ mɛn dɔ, wo kɛnin tɛ Judiya bɛrɛ jɛrɛ ri. Faaninta kɛ bɛrɛ ko kɛnin tɛ faribanku ko gbansan de ri. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Kɔni mɔɔ ye kɛla Judiya bɛrɛ ri a kɔndɔ koilu le fɛ. Faaninta kɛ bɛrɛ ye tola mɔɔ jusu le rɔ ka fara Nii Sɛniman na, sariya sɛbɛnin tɛ. Wo mɔɔ su tɛ tandoli sɔrɔnna adamadenilu la fɔɔ Alla jɛrɛ.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Nfen ka Judiyailu lafisaya mɔɔ doilu ko wo rɔ? Faaninta tɔnɔ ye nfen di? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Tɔnɔ siyaman ye a la ɲa bɛɛ ma. A fɔlɔ ye mɛn di, Alla ra a la kumailu karifa Judiyailu la. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Awa, wo ye di, ni lemɛniya tɛ mɔɔ doilu rɔ, wo ri Alla la landaɲa tiɲan wa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ɛɛn de! Tuɲa tii le Alla ri hali mɔɔilu bɛɛ wa kɛ wuya fɔlailu ri. A sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko, «kosa i wa kuma, ile le telennin. I wa makiti, i ri jo sɔrɔn.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.4</char> Yaburi suran 51 kuma diya 6</note><verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Kɔni ni an na telenbaliya ka Alla la telen nabɔ kɛnɛma, an di nfen fɔ ka bɛn ko wo ma? Alla tɛ telenbaliya le kɛla wo rɔ wa, a wa a la mɔnɛ lajii an ma? N ye kumala ikomin mɔɔilu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ɛɛn de! Ni a tɛrɛ wo ɲa le ma, Alla ri se dunuɲa makitila di?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kɔni wo ye di? Ni Alla la tuɲa ye lɛnkɛnɛmayala n na wuya le fɛ, a la gbiliya ye makafu, nfenna nde ri jalaki wo rɔ ikomin julumuntii? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Wo rɔ, nfenna an tɛ a fɔla ko, «An ye kojuu kɛ kosa koɲuma ye bɔ a rɔ wa?» Wuya fɔla doilu ye wo kuma lala an kun ma. Wo tiilu jalaki ta le.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔ si tɛ ye mɛn telennin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />A ye di wo rɔ? Andeilu ka fisa doilu ko wa? Ɛɛn de! An tɛrɛ ra a yiraka ko Judiyailu ni siya gbɛrɛilu bɛɛ ye julumun fanka kɔrɔ, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">«Mɔɔ telennin si ti ye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">hali kelen pe!<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Mɔɔ si ti ye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">mɛn ka ko lɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">Mɔɔ si ti ye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">mɛn ye Alla ɲininna.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ra sila fara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Ii bɛɛ ra to fufafu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Mɔɔ si tɛ a ɲuma kɛla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">hali mɔɔ kelen pe!<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Ii kan woilu lakanin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ikomin kaburu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">janfa kumailu le ii nɛn kan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Ii kumakanilu diminnin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ikomin fɔngbɛ baa.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Ii da lafanin dankailu ni kuma kunanniilu le la.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Ii kaliyanin jeli labɔ diya.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Gbalo ni tiɲannin de ii la silailu kan.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ii ma jususuma sila lɔn!<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Ii tɛ silanna Alla ɲɛrɔ muumɛ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.18</char> Yaburi suran 14 kuma diya 1 haan 3 ni suran 53 kuma diya 2 haan 4 ni suran 5 kuma diya 10 ni suran 140 kuma diya 4 ni Esayi suran 59 kuma diya 7 haan 8 a ni Yaburi suran 36 kuma diya 2</note><verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Awa, an ka a lɔn ko sariya ka mɛn bɛɛ fɔ, a ka a fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ mɛnilu ye sariya kɔrɔ, kosa bɛɛ da ye mira, ka dunuɲa mɔɔilu bɛɛ lɔn tiɲanninna ri Alla ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Wo le rɔ, adamaden si tɛ jate mɔɔ telennin di Alla ɲakɔrɔ sariya mira fɛ, baa sariya ye julumun de dɔrɔn yirakala an na.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Kɔni sisɛn, ka bɔ sariya wo ma, Alla la telen da bɔ kɛnɛma, Sariya Kitabu ni kelalaselailu la kitabuilu tɛrɛ ra mɛn sereya bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Mɛnilu bɛɛ wa lemɛniya, Alla ri woilu latelen a ɲakɔrɔ lemɛniya fɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn dannafarabɔ tɛ ye, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />baa mɔɔ bɛɛ ra hakɛ kɛ. Wo le rɔ, ii ma Alla la gbiliya sɔrɔn. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Kɔni Alla ye mɔɔilu jatela telenba ri, lafɛrɛ rɔ a la hina le fɛ, ka ii kunka Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Alla ka ale le kɛ sɔlɔnalila saraka ri, mɔɔ mɛnilu wa lemɛniya a jeli ma. Wo ra a la telen yiraka, baa julumun mɛnilu kɛra sani sinɛn, a tɛrɛ tɛ mɔɔilu julumunilu sarala ii la a la diɲɛ waati rɔ, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />kɔni a wa kɛ a la telen yiraka ko rɔ waati ɲin dɔ, kosa a ye telen fewu, ka mɔɔilu latelen a ɲakɔrɔ mɛnilu ra lemɛniya Isa ma.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Wo rɔ, mɔɔilu ka kan ka ii jɛrɛ matɔɔ nfenna? Foyi! Nfenna? Ii ra sariya mira, ii ye ii jɛrɛ matɔɔla wo le rɔ wa? Ɛɛn, wo tɛ, fɔɔ ii la lemɛniya. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ka a masɔrɔn an lanin a la ko mɔɔ ye telenna Alla ɲakɔrɔ lemɛniya le fɛ, hali ka bɔ sariya mira ma. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Judiyailu le dɔrɔn ta ye Alla ri wa? Siya gbɛrɛilu fanan na Alla le tɛ ale ri wa? Siya gbɛrɛilu fanan na Alla le a ri fewu! <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Alla kelen de a ri mɛn di Judiya kojiikɛninilu latelen a ɲakɔrɔ lemɛniya fɛ a ni siya gbɛrɛilu fanan wo lemɛniya kelen fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Wo kɔrɔ le ko an ye sariya bila lemɛniya fɛ wa? Ɛɛn de! Kɔni, an ye sariya jatela.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Iburahima misaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />An ye nfen fɔ an siya benba Iburahima la ko rɔ wo rɔ? A ka nfen yen ko ɲin dɔ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ni Iburahima telenda Alla ɲakɔrɔ a kɛwali le fɛ, a tɛrɛ ri a jɛrɛ matɔɔ wo rɔ. Kɔni a ti se wo kɛla Alla ɲakɔrɔ! <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Baa Kitabu ka nfen fɔ ka bɛn wo ko ma? A ka a fɔ ko, «Iburahima lemɛniyara Alla ma, wo rɔ Alla ka wo jate telen di a yɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.3</char> A Damira suran 15 kuma diya 6</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mɔɔ mɛn wa baara, ka a sara sɔrɔn, wo tɛ jatela sanba ri a yɛ, baa a la baara sara le a ri. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Kɔni mɔɔ mɛn tɛ baarala, kɔni a lanin Alla la mɛn ye Alla lɔnbaliilu latelenna, Alla ye wo tii la lemɛniya jatela telen di. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Dawuda fanan ka mɔɔ la sɛwa la ko fɔ wo ɲa le ma, Alla ka mɛn jate mɔɔ telennin di, ka fara kɛwaliilu la ko,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Sɛwa ye wo tii yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">mɛn na sariya tiɲanniilu ra makoto</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">mɛn julumunilu ra kafari.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Sɛwa ye wo adamaden yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">Maari tɛ mɛn na julumun jatela.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.8</char> Yaburi suran 32 kuma diya 1 haan 2</note><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Wo sɛwa kɛnin Judiya kojiikɛninilu le gbansan ta ri wa wala siya gbɛrɛilu fanan? Awa, an bansan de a fɔla ko, Alla ka Iburahima la lemɛniya jate le telen di a yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kɔni wo kɛra waati ɲuman na? A tɛrɛ ra faaninta kɛ wala a tɛrɛ ma faaninta kɛ? A tɛrɛ ma faaninta kɛ! <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />A ka kojii kɛ sɔrɔn de a la telenbaya tɔɔmasereya la, a ka mɛn sɔrɔn a la lemɛniya fɛ sani a ye faaninta kɛ waati mɛn na. Wo le rɔ, Iburahima kɛra mɔɔilu bɛɛ benba ri mɛnilu lemɛniyanin Alla ma hali ii ma faaninta kɛ, kosa telen di jate ii fanan yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Mɛnilu ka faaninta kɛ, ii bilanin an benba Iburahima la lemɛniya kɔfɛ fanan Iburahima tɛrɛ mɛn dɔ sani a ye faaninta kɛ, woilu fanan benba le Iburahima ri.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ka lahidi mɛn sidi Iburahima yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Baa Alla ka lahidi mɛn sidi Iburahima ni a bɔnsɔnilu yɛ, ko dunuɲa ri kɛ ii cɛ ri, wo tɛrɛ ma lakanbali sariya fɛ kɔni a ra lakanbali a la telenbaya baraka rɔ mɛn ye nala lemɛniya fɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.13</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 12 kuma diya 2 haan 3 ni suran 17 kuma diya 4 haan 6 ni suran 22 kuma diya 15 haan 18 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Baa ni mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ka wo cɛ sɔrɔn sariya mira le fɛ, wo rɔ lemɛniya tɔnɔ tɛ ye. Alla ka lahidi sidi le an yɛ wo rɔ fuyan! <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ka a masɔrɔn sariya le nala Alla la mɔnɛ ri, ni sariya ti ye, sariya tiɲan fanan ti ye.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Wo rɔ, Alla ka lahidi mɛn sidi Iburahima yɛ lemɛniya baraka rɔ, kosa a ye kɛ hina ri a ni ko latɛɛnin Iburahima bɔnsɔnilu bɛɛ yɛ mɛnilu jɛrɛ ye sariya kɔrɔ, woilu gbansan tɛ kɔni mɛnilu fanan lemɛniyara ikomin Iburahima. Iburahima le an bɛɛ benba ri, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «N da i kɛ siya siyamanilu benba ri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.17</char> A Damira suran 17 kuma diya 5</note> Ale le an benba ri Alla ɲakɔrɔ, Iburahima lemɛniyara Alla mɛn ma, Alla mɛn ye mɔɔ faaniilu nii bilala ii rɔ, Alla mɛn ye fenilu jamarila mɛn tɛ ye, wo ri kɛ ye. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Iburahima lemɛniyara le a jii ma, hali a la jii kun tɛrɛ tɛ yenna. Wo ɲa ma, a kɛra «siya siyamanilu benba ri,» ikomin Alla ka a fɔ a yɛ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «I bɔnsɔnilu totɔ wo ɲa le ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.18</char> A Damira suran 15 kuma diya 5</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />A tɛrɛ ma siya butun a ni san kɛmɛ (100) sɔrɔn, foyida a faribanku tɛrɛ faa ko rɔ, a la muso Saran fanan kɛnin tɛrɛ densɔrɔnbali le ri kɔni a la lemɛniya tɛrɛ kɛndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Alla ka lahidi mɛn sidi, a ma sika wo ma lemɛniyabaliya rɔ, kɔni a la lemɛniya ka a fanka don de, a ka Alla gbiliya. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />A lanin tɛrɛ a la fewu, ko Alla ka lahidi mɛn sidi, a fanka ri se wo lakanbalila. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Wo le rɔ, Alla ka wo jate le telen di a yɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.22</char> A Damira suran 15 kuma diya 6</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Kɔni wo kuma sɛbɛnin tɛ ale kelen na ko rɔ ko, «A jatenin de a yɛ.» <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />A sɛbɛnin ande le fanan yɛ, baa wo ri jate telen di andeilu fanan yɛ, an wa lemɛniya Alla ma mɛn ka an Maari Isa lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Isa donda bolo rɔ a faa ko rɔ an julumunilu le la ko rɔ, ka wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, an natelen na ko rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Telenbaya la ko Alla ɲakɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Wo rɔ, an da telen Alla ɲakɔrɔ lemɛniya baraka rɔ, bɛn da kɛ an ni Alla tɛma an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />A ra an nana a la hina rɔ lemɛniya fɛ an ye mɛn dɔ ten. An sɛwanin de Alla la gbiliya ko jii la. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Wo gbansan tɛ, kɔni an sɛwanin fanan an na tɔrɔyailu la ka a masɔrɔn an ka a lɔn ko tɔrɔya le tunadiya lanala. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Tunadiya ye kɛɲa bɛrɛ lanala. Kɛɲa bɛrɛ ye jii lanala. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Wo jii tɛ an majuuwaya, ka a masɔrɔn Alla ra a la kaninteya la an jusu rɔ a la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ, a ra mɛn di an ma.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ka a masɔrɔn fanka tɛrɛ tɛ an na waati mɛn na, Ɲenematɔmɔnin faara Alla lɔnbaliilu la ko la a la waati latɛɛnin dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Foyida mɔɔ si tɛrɛ tɛ sɔn faala mɔɔ telennin na ko rɔ, kɔni tumadɔ, mɔɔ do ri susu faala mɔɔ ɲuma la ko rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Kɔni Alla ka a la kaninteya yiraka an na wo ɲa le ma, an tɛrɛ ye kojuukɛlailu ri waati mɛn na, Ɲenematɔmɔnin faara an yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Sisɛn ni an da telen Alla ɲakɔrɔ Isa jeli fɛ, a tɛna kaɲala an kisila Alla la mɔnɛ ma a baraka rɔ! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ni an tɛrɛ ye Alla juuya la waati mɛn na, an ni Alla tɛmala rabɛnda a Dencɛ la saya fɛ, ni an tɛmala rabɛnda wo rɔ, a kaɲa kun ti ye wo rɔ an nakisi la a Dencɛ nii baraka rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Kɔni a bɛɛ tɛ wo ri, an sɛwanin Alla la an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ mɛn da bɛn nadon an ni Alla tɛma sinɛn.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">An Benba Adama ni Isa la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Wo le rɔ, julumun nara dunuɲa rɔ mɔɔ kelen pe le fɛ, saya fanan nara julumun fɛ. Wo le rɔ, saya ra na mɔɔ bɛɛ ma, ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ bɛɛ ra julumun kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Julumun tɛrɛ ye dunuɲa rɔ sani sariya ye na, adon ni sariya ti ye, julumun fanan ti jatela. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Kɔni ka damira an benba Adama la waati ma haan ka wa se Musa la waati ma, saya ye mansaya kɛla mɔɔ bɛɛ kun na, hali mɛnilu ma an benba Adama la julumun su kɛ mɛn ka julumun ta Alla la jamarili fɛ. An benba Adama kɛnin tɛrɛ mɔɔ natɔ misali le ri. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Kɔni Alla la sɔli munuɲanin tɛ Adama hakɛ na. Hali mɔɔ siyaman da saya masɔrɔn ale kelen hakɛ fɛ, Alla la hina ni a la sɔli ka bon wo ri pon, a ka mɛn siyaman ba di mɔɔ siyaman ma mɔɔ kelen pe baraka rɔ, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Alla la sɔli kɛnin tɛ ikomin mɔɔ kelen na hakɛ fanan. Baa hakɛ kelen kiti ra a kɛ adamadenilu ra jalaki, kɔni Alla la sɔli nanin hakɛ siyaman kɛ kɔ le rɔ, ka telenbaya lana. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Baa ni saya ra fanka sɔrɔn mɔɔ kelen na hakɛ fɛ, wo mɔɔ kelen na ko rɔ, wo mɔɔilu fanan ti kaɲa fanka sɔrɔnna Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin kelen na dunuɲaratɛɛ fɛ, mɛnilu ye Alla la hina ba sɔrɔnna a ni a la sɔlifen mɛn kɛnin telen di?<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Wo le rɔ, bɛɛ ye jalakila ɲa mɛn ma hakɛ kelen fɛ, kɛwali telennin kelen ɲin fanan di kɛ telen di wo ɲa ma mɛn ye ɲenemaya lanala mɔɔilu bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Baa mɔɔ siyaman kɛnin julumuntiilu ri ɲa mɛn ma mɔɔ kelen na kuma mirabaliya fɛ, mɔɔ siyaman fanan di telen wo ɲa ma Alla ɲakɔrɔ mɔɔ kelen na kuma mira baraka rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Sariya ra na kosa hakɛilu ye siyaya, kɔni julumun bonyanin yɔrɔ mɛn na, Alla la hina fanan da wara ye. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Wo le rɔ, julumun mansaya kɛnin ɲa mɛn ma saya rɔ, Alla la hina fanan ye mansaya kɛla telenbaya rɔ wo ɲa le ma, a ka an nadon ɲenemaya banbali rɔ, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Saya ni siimaya Isa fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />An di nfen fɔ, wo rɔ? An di to julumunilu kɛla wa kosa Alla la hina ye wara? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ɛɛn de! An da faa julumun fan fɛ, an di to an na dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛla julumun dɔ wa? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko andeilu mɛn bɛɛ ra sun ji rɔ kɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa tɔɔ rɔ, ko an da sun ji rɔ kɛ a fɛ a la saya rɔ? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Wo rɔ, an ni Isa ra su don an ɲɔɔn fɛ a la saya rɔ an sunnin ji rɔ waati mɛn na, kosa Ɲenematɔmɔnin wulinin ka bɔ saya rɔ ɲa mɛn ma Fa la gbiliya rɔ, an fanan ye taama dunuɲaratɛɛ kura rɔ wo ɲa ma.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ka a masɔrɔn ni an bɛɛ ra kɛ kelen di a la saya rɔ, an fanan di wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ ikomin ale. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />An ye ɲin lɔn: an na mɔɔya kɔrɔ ra gbɔngbɔn Isa fɛ jiri kan, kosa an na mɔɔya mɛn ye julumun dɔ, wo ye ban an dɔ ka bɔ julumun jɔnya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ wa faa, a ri hɔrɔya julumun ma.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Wo rɔ, ni an ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin da faa an ɲɔɔn fɛ, an lanin a la wo rɔ fanan ko an di an na dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛ an ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ka a masɔrɔn an ka a lɔn ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin da wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, a tɛ faala butun, saya kana mansaya kɛ a kun na butun. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ka a masɔrɔn a faara le, a faara julumun de la ko rɔ siɲa kelen haan habadan. Sinɛn a ye a nii la, a la siimaya rɔ Alla le yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />A ye wo ɲa le ma, ai fanan ye ai jɛrɛ jate mɔɔ faaniilu ri fewu julumun ma, kɔni ai tonin ai la siimaya rɔ Alla yɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa le rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Wo le rɔ, julumun kana mansaya kɛ ai faribanku rɔ butun, ka kolo a diyanan koilu kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ai kana ai fari yɔrɔ si di julumun dɔ ikomin kɛlɛkɛfen di telenbaliya yɛ, kɔni ai ye ai jɛrɛ di Alla ma, ikomin mɔɔ ɲenemanilu mɛn da bɔ saya rɔ. Ai ye ai fari yɔrɔ bɛɛ di Alla le ma ikomin kɛlɛkɛfen telenbaya yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Wo rɔ, julumun kana mansaya kɛ ai kun na, baa ai tɛ sariya kɔrɔ butun, fɔɔ Alla la hina.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Telenbaya la jɔnilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Wo ye di wo rɔ? A bɛnnin an ye to hakɛ kɛla wa, baa an tɛ sariya kɔrɔ butun, fɔɔ Alla la hina? Ɛɛn de! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ai ma a lɔn wa, ko ai wa ai jɛrɛ don mɔɔ do bolo ka kɛ a kan mira jɔn di, ai kɛtɔ wo tii la jɔn de ri ai ye mɛn kan mirala wa? Ni a ri kɛ julumun di, ka i faa, wala ni a ri kɛ Alla kan mirala ri, ka i bila telen sila kan. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Kɔni an ye baraka bila Alla yɛ, baa julumun na jɔnilu le tɛrɛ ai ri, kɔni karan mɛn karifara ai la, ai ra wo mira ai jusu rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ai ra kanhɔrɔya julumun ma, ka ai kɛ telenbaya la jɔnilu ri. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />N da dunuɲa misali ɲin fɔ ai yɛ kosa ai ye a ɲayen ai la fankatanya la ko kosɔn. A damira ai tɛrɛ ra ai fari yɔrɔ bɛɛ di kɔsɔ koilu ni kojuuilu ma jɔnya rɔ, ai la kojuuilu tora wala warala. Kɔni sisɛn, ai ye ai fari yɔrɔ bɛɛ di telenbaya ma jɔnya rɔ, ka ai bila sɛninya sila kan.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ai tɛrɛ ye julumun jɔnya rɔ waati mɛn na, ai tɛrɛ tɛ telenbaya kɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ai ka ko mɛnilu kɛ wo waati rɔ, ai maloyanin mɛnilu la ten, ai tɛrɛ ra tɔnɔ ɲuman sɔrɔn woilu la? Woilu laban kɛnin saya le ri. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Kɔni sisɛn, ai ra kanhɔrɔya julumun ma, ka kɛ Alla la jɔnilu ri, ka ai bila ai dan na Alla yɛ, wo le kɛnin ai la tɔnɔ ri, mɛn naban kɛnin ɲenemaya banbali ri. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Baa julumun sara le saya ri, kɔni Alla la sɔlifen, ɲenemaya banbali le wo ri an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu ra hɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />N badenmailu, aile mɛnilu ka sariya lɔn, ai ka a lɔn ko sariya ye mɔɔ jamarilila haan a laban waati. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />A misaliya kɛnin muso le ri mɛn siinin cɛɛ kun ma. Wo siinin a la cɛɛ kun ma sariya le ma haan a ye a niila waati mɛn na, kɔni ni a la cɛɛ faara, a ye bɔ sariya kɔrɔ mɛn tɛrɛ ka ii sidi ii ɲɔɔn ma. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Wo le rɔ, ni a siira cɛɛ gbɛrɛ kun ma, a cɛɛ fɔlɔ ye a nii la, a ra kaninkɛ wo rɔ. Kɔni ni a la cɛɛ faara, wo rɔ a ra bɔ wo la sariya kɔrɔ. Wo rɔ, a ri se siila cɛɛ gbɛrɛ kun ma, wo kɛnin tɛ kaninkɛ ri. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />N badenmailu, ai le fanan da faa sariya fan fɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin faribanku baraka rɔ, kosa, ai ri ai fasa a ma, mɛn da wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ kosa an ye baara ɲumailu kɛ Alla yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Baa faribanku diyanan koilu tɛrɛ ye an jamarila waati mɛn dɔ, julumun diyanan koilu tɛrɛ ye baarala an fariilu rɔ sariya fɛ kosa mɛn tɛrɛ ye an faala an ka wo kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Kɔni sisɛn, an da bɔ sariya kɔrɔ, ka a masɔrɔn an da faa sariya kɔrɔ, mɛn tɛrɛ ra an mira. An ye baarala Nii Sɛniman na sila kura le kan sinɛn, an tɛ sariya sɛbɛnin kɔrɔman kan butun.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya ni hakɛilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />An ye nfen fɔla wo rɔ? Sariya jɛrɛ le julumun di wa? Ɛɛn de! Sariya le ka a kɛ n ka a lɔn ko nfen ye julumun di. Ni sariya tɛrɛ ma a fɔ n yɛ, «i kana nata», n tɛrɛ ma a lɔn nfen ye nata ri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.7</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 20 kuma diya 17 ni Sariyailu suran 5 kuma diya 21 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Wo rɔ, julumun ka fɛrɛ sɔrɔn, ka nata su bɛɛ ladon n dɔ sariya fɛ. Ka a masɔrɔn ni sariya tɛrɛ tɛ ye, julumun faanin de tɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Sariya tɛrɛ tɛ n kan waati mɛn na, n tɛrɛ kɛndɛ, kɔni jamarili nanin, julumun nara, wo rɔ n faara. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />N da a yen ko, jamarili mɛn ka kan ka siimaya lana, wo nanin saya le fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Baa, julumun da fɛrɛ sɔrɔn jamarili fɛ, ka n janfa, ka n faa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Wo le rɔ, sariya sɛniman, jamarili sɛniman, a telennin, a ka ɲin. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Wo kɔrɔ ye di? Kuma mɛn ka ɲin, wo ra kɛ saya ri nde yɛ? Ɛɛn de! Julumun de ra n faa wo fen ɲuma fɛ, kosa julumun ko ri lɔn julumun di, kosa julumun fankama ka yiraka jamarili fɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Julumun ka fanka sɔrɔn mɔɔilu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />An ka a lɔn ko sariya faranin Alla la Nii Sɛniman de la, kɔni faribanku le nde ri, mɛn da mayira ka a kɛ julumun jɔn di. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />N ma a lɔn n ye mɛn kɛla, ka a masɔrɔn n ye a fɛ ka mɛn kɛ, n tɛ wo kɛla, kɔni fɔɔ mɛn gboman n yɛ, n ye wo le kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ni n tɛ a fɛ ka mɛn kɛ, n ye wo le kɛla, wo ye a yirakala ko n da sɔn ko sariya ka ɲin. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Wo rɔ, nde tɛ wo kɛla, kɔni julumun de wo ri mɛn ye n dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ka a masɔrɔn n ka a lɔn ko koɲuma tɛ n dɔ ka fara n faribanku la, baa hali koɲuma kɛ lɔɔ ye n na, n ti se a kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />N ye a fɛ ka koɲuma mɛn kɛ, n tɛ wo kɛla, kɔni n tɛ a fɛ ka kojuu mɛn kɛ, n ye tola wo le kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ko mɛn kɛ lɔɔ tɛ n na, ni n ka wo kɛ, wo kɔrɔ le, ko nde ma a kɛ, kɔni julumun mɛn ye n ma.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Wo le rɔ, N ye a yenna ko sariya le ɲin di. Koɲuma kɛ lɔɔ ye n na waati mɛn dɔ, kojuu fanan ye n dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Adon, n sɛwanin Alla la sariya yɛ, n jusu rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Kɔni n ye sariya gbɛrɛ le yenna n faribanku rɔ mɛn ye n hankili sariya kɛlɛla, ka n kɛ kasolabilala ri julumun na sariya rɔ, mɛn ye baarala n faribanku rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mɔɔ tɔrɔnin de n di! Yon de n kunkala faribanku ɲin ni a diyanan koilu ma mɛnilu ye n nawala saya rɔ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />An ye baraka bila Alla yɛ an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ! Wo rɔ, n da kɛ Alla la sariya jɔn di n hankili rɔ, kɔni n faribanku ra n kɛ julumun sariya jɔn di.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Wo le rɔ, mɔɔ mɛnilu ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa fɛ, Alla tɛ woilu jalakila sinɛn, <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />ka a masɔrɔn, Nii Sɛniman na nii lakisi sariya ra i hɔrɔya julumun ni saya sariya ma Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa baraka rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Baa sariya tɛrɛ ti se wo kɛla, ka a masɔrɔn faribanku ra a fanka ban. Alla le ka wo kɛ, a ka a jɛrɛ Dencɛ lana adamaden julumuntiilu sawura rɔ julumun sarakaya la, ka julumun jalaki faribanku rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Alla ka wo kɛ le kosa telen mɛn ka kan ka kɛ sariya la ko rɔ, wo ye dafa an dɔ, ande mɛnilu tɛ taamana an faribanku diyanan koilu rɔ, kɔni fɔɔ Nii Sɛniman diyanan koilu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Awa, mɛnilu ye taamanna ii faribanku diyanan koilu rɔ, woilu ye tola ii mirila wo ko suilu le ma, kɔni mɛnilu ye Nii Sɛniman diyanan koilu kɛla, woilu ye tola ii mirila Nii Sɛniman na koilu le ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Faribanku nata miriyailu wa to i la, saya le wo ri, kɔni ni i miriyailu bɔnin Nii Sɛniman de rɔ, siimaya le wo ri a ni jususuma. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn faribanku nata miriyailu kɛnin Alla juu le ri, baa ii ti ii kolola Alla la sariya kɔrɔ, ii ti se wo kɛla fanan! <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Mɛnilu ye taamanna ii faribanku diyanan koilu rɔ, woilu ti Alla hɛnɛ muumɛ!<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Kɔni aile tɛ taamanna ai faribanku diyanan koilu rɔ fɔɔ Nii Sɛniman diyanan koilu, ni tuɲa le ko Alla la Nii Sɛniman ye ai rɔ. Nba, ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin Nii tɛ mɔɔ mɛn dɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta tɛ wo tii ri. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Kɔni ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye ai rɔ, ai faribanku faara julumun na ko kosɔn, kɔni ai nii ye ye, ka a masɔrɔn ai ra jate mɔɔ telennin di. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Adon, Nii mɛn ka Isa lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, ni wo le tonin ai rɔ, ale mɛn ka Ɲenematɔmɔnin nawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, wo ri nii di ai faribankuilu ma a la Nii baraka rɔ mɛn ye tola ai rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, donin ye an kun ma, kɔni faribanku le donin tɛ an kun ma ka a diyanan koilu kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Baa ni ai tora taamanna ai faribanku diyanan koilu rɔ, ai ri faa; kɔni ni ai ka ai faribanku kɛwalijuuilu faa Nii fɛ, ai ri to nii la. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Baa Alla Nii wa mɔɔ mɛnilu bolo mira, Alla la dencɛilu le woilu ri. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Baa ai ka Nii mɛn sɔrɔn, wo tɛ ai kɛ silan jɔn di ikɔ tuun, kɔni a ra ai kɛ Alla la dencɛilu mɔɔdennabɔla ri. Nii mɛn ye an lɔla Alla kilila ko, «Baba, n Fa!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Nii jɛrɛ ye sereya bɔla an nii fɛ, Alla la dencɛilu le andeilu ri. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ni an kɛnin Alla la denilu ri, an ye nala le cɛ sɔrɔnna ikomin a denilu baa Alla ka baraji mɛn namara Ɲenematɔmɔnin yɛ, an fanan di wo sɔrɔn. Ni an ni Isa le tɔrɔnin an ɲɔɔn fɛ, an bɛɛ le a la gbiliya sɔrɔnna wo rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gbiliya mɛn ye nala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />N da a lɔn ko an ye tɔrɔya mɛn sɔrɔnna sisɛn, a ni gbiliya mɛn ye nala, woilu tɛma ka jan kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Baa dalifen bɛɛ gbɛrɛnnin Alla makɔnɔla, a natanin wo waati rɔ haan Alla dencɛilu nɔɔrɔ ye bɔla kɛnɛma waati mɛn na. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Baa dalifen tora le kɔrɔntɔnin a kɔrɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.20</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 3 kuma diya 17</note> A sawo tɛrɛ tɛ wo ri, kɔni Alla sawo le kɛnin wo ɲa ma kosa jii ye sɔrɔn, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ko dalifen di hɔrɔya tiɲannin ko jɔnya ma, a nanin Alla la denilu kanhɔrɔya bɛrɛ diya le. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ka a masɔrɔn an di a lɔn, kɛbi a damira haan waati ɲin dɔ, a kɛnin ikomin dalifen bɛɛ kurunna tɔrɔya rɔ ikomin muso mɛn ye tin ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Wo ko kelen tɛ, kɔni andeilu mɛnilu fanan ka Nii Sɛniman kunfɔlɔ sɔrɔn, an fanan ye kurunna, an ye Alla makɔnɔla waati mɛn na ka an kɛ a denilu mɔɔdennabɔla ri, ka an faribanku kunka. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Baa an tɛrɛ ra kisi jii fɛ. Adon, an jii lanin ko mɛn dɔ, ni an di wo yen, wo tɛ kilila ko jii. Yon jii lanin a rɔ, a ra ban mɛn sɔrɔnna? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Kɔni an tɛrɛ ma mɛn sɔrɔn, ni an ka an jii la wo rɔ, an ye a makɔnɔla le dɔrɔn.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Nii Sɛniman ye andeilu fankatanilu dɛmɛnna wo ɲa kelen de ma, baa an ma a lɔn an ka kan ka Alla matara mɛn ma. Kɔni Nii Sɛniman jɛrɛ ye Alla madiyala an yɛ kurun mɛn ti se fɔla. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Alla mɛn ye mɔɔilu jusu rɔ koilu ɲininna, wo ka Nii Sɛniman miriya lɔn, ka a masɔrɔn Nii Sɛniman ye Alla madiyala a la jama sɛniman yɛ ikomin Alla sawo ye ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />An ka a lɔn ko Alla ye koilu bɛɛ labanna a ɲuma le ma a kanin mɔɔilu yɛ, a ka mɛnilu kili a la ko latɛɛnin ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Baa Alla ka mɛnilu suwandi a damira la, a ra a latɛɛ fanan ko a ri woilu kɛ a Dencɛ munuɲailu ri, kosa Isa ye kɛ ikomin den fɔlɔ yɛ a dɔɔni siyaman tɛma. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Alla tɛrɛ ra wo latɛɛ mɛnilu ma, a ra woilu kili. A ka mɛnilu kili, a ra woilu latelen a ɲakɔrɔ. A ka mɛnilu latelen a ɲakɔrɔ, a ra woilu gbiliya.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la kaninteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Wo rɔ, an ye nfen fɔ wo ko rɔ? Ni Alla ye an fɛ, yon ye wulila an kanma wo rɔ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ale mɛn ma a jɛrɛ dencɛ latanka, kɔni ka a di an bɛɛ ma, nfenna wo rɔ a tɛ fen bɛɛ donna an bolo ikomin dabundɛ a Dencɛ fɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Alla ra mɔɔ mɛnilu suwandi, yon di woilu jalaki? Alla le mɔɔ latelenna. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Yon di se an jalakila? Mɔɔ si ti se, baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa ra faa, ka bɔ wo la, a ra lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, ka a lɔ Alla bolokinin ma, ka Alla madiya an yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nfen ye an bɔla Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kaninteya rɔ? Tɔrɔya ni kɔndafili wa, wala bɛsɛnkɔlɔnteya wala kɔnkɔ wala feriyabɔ ko wala gbalo wala saya fanmuru la? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko, «Ii ye an faala ile le la ko kosɔn telen gben! Ii ye an kɛla ikomin saailu mɛn ye kannatɛɛ la!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.36</char> Yaburi suran 44 kuma diya 23</note> <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Kɔni mɛn wa an kanin, an di nɔ sɔrɔn wo fɛ ko ɲinilu bɛɛ rɔ fewu. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Baa n da a lɔn fewu, saya wala dunuɲaratɛɛ wala mɛlɛkailu wala jenailu wala waati ɲinilu wala waati rɔ ko natɔilu wala fankamailu <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />wala sankolo rɔ fenilu wala duu kɔrɔ fenilu, wala dalifen si, foyi tɛ wo rɔ, mɛn ye an bɔla Alla la kaninteya rɔ an ka mɛn sɔrɔn an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Alla ka mɔɔ mɛnilu suwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />N ye tuɲa fɔla ai yɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ, n tɛ wuya fɔla, n hankili ri sereya bɔ wo la Nii Sɛniman na ko kosɔn: <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />N sununnin, n jusu tɔrɔnin waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Baa, n tɛrɛ ye a fɛ le nde jɛrɛ le ye Alla la danka sɔrɔn, ka mataa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na n badenmailu la ko rɔ, n wara mɔɔilu, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Isirayɛlikailu, iile mɛnilu ta ye Alla dencɛ mɔɔdennabɔla ri, a ni a la gbiliya ni a la teriyailu ni a la sariya ni a bato ɲailu a batobon kɔndɔ, a ni a la lahidiilu. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Ii faranin benba fɔlɔilu le la, Ɲenematɔmɔnin bɔra iile le rɔ adamadenya ɲa rɔ. Alla mɛn ye fen bɛɛ kun na, wo ye tando habadan! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Adon, wo tɛ wo ri de ko Alla la lahidi tɔnɔ tɛ ye, baa Isirayɛlikailu bɛɛ kɛnin tɛ Alla la jama ri Isirayɛli. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ii sɔrɔn Iburahima bɔnsɔn dɔ, wo tɛ ko ii bɛɛ kɛnin Iburahima den bɛrɛilu le ri. Ka a masɔrɔn Alla ka a fɔ le a yɛ ko, «Mɛnilu ye jatela i bɔnsɔn dɔ, woilu ye bɔla Isiyaka bɔnsɔn de rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.7</char> A Damira suran 21 kuma diya 12</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Wo le wo ri, den mɛnilu sɔrɔnnin adamadenya ɲa ma, Alla la den tɛ woilu ri, kɔni fɔɔ Alla ka Iburahima lahidi den mɛnilu la, woilu le kɛnin a bɔnsɔn bɛrɛilu ri. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Baa Alla ka Iburahima lahidi wo ɲa le ma ko, «N di na waati latɛɛnin dɔ, Saran di dencɛ sɔrɔn.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> A Damira suran 18 kuma diya 10 haan 14</note><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />A bɛɛ tɛ wo ri, Rebeka den filailu bɛɛ ye fa kelen de la, an benba Isiyaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Adon, sani den ɲinilu ye sɔrɔn, sani ii ye koɲuma kɛ wala a juuman, Alla tɛrɛ ra a latɛɛ ko kelen ye suwandi <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />hali ka fara ii kɛwaliilu la kɔni fɔɔ a ka mɛn kili. A ka a fɔ Rebeka yɛ ko, «Kɔrɔ ri to dɔɔni fanka kɔrɔ.» <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ten de ko, «N da Yakuba kanin kɔni n da Esawu kɔn.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.13</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 25 kuma diya 23 ni Malaki suran 1 kuma diya 2 haan 3 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />An di nfen fɔ wo rɔ? Alla ka telenbaliya le kɛ wo rɔ wa? Ɛɛn de! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Baa a ra a fɔ Musa yɛ ko, «N di hina mɔɔ la, n ye hinala mɛn na, n di kininkinin mɔɔ ma, n ye kininkininna mɛn ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.15</char> Hɔrɔya suran 33 kuma diya 19</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Wo tɛ faranin mɔɔ diyanan koilu le la wala a kɛwaliilu, kɔni fɔɔ Alla la hina. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ, Alla ka a fɔ Ferawuna yɛ ko, «N da i kɛ mansa ri kosa n ye n fanka yiraka ile fɛ, n tɔɔ ri lase dunuɲa yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.17</char> Hɔrɔya suran 9 kuma diya 16</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Wo rɔ, Alla wa hina mɛn na a ri hina wo la, a wa kɛ mɛn kun gbɛlɛnyala, a ri a kun gbɛlɛnya.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla la mɔnɛ ni a la kininkinin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ile ri a fɔ n yɛ wo rɔ ko, «Nfenna Alla ye an jalakila butun? Baa yon di se a banna Alla sawo ma?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ile, adamaden dɔrɔn, i ye yon di, mɛn ye Alla masɔsɔla? Bankudaa ti se a fɔla a ladan mɔɔ ma wa ko, «nfenna i ye n nadanna ten?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Awa, se tɛ bankudaa ladanna yɛ wa, ka bankudaa fila ladan bankudaa banku kelen na, kelen kɛɲi ba le, do bankudaa gbansan?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Wo ye di, ni Alla ye a fɛ ka a la mɔnɛ ni a la fanka yiraka, wo le rɔ a ra diɲɛ kosɛbɛ, ka a lɔ wo mɔɔilu kɔrɔ a mɔnɛra mɛnilu ma, mɛnilu rabɛnnin tɛrɛ halaki kanma? <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Wo ye di, ni a ka wo kɛ le kosa a ye a la gbiliya ba yiraka wo mɔɔilu la, a kininkininda mɛnilu la, a tun da mɛnilu rabɛn a la gbiliya sɔrɔn kanma? <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Wo le andeilu ri, a ka mɛnilu kili, ka bɔ Judiyailu tɛma kɔni an kelen tɛ, ka bɔ siya gbɛrɛilu fanan tɛma. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ikomin a ka a fɔ Hoseya la kitabu kɔndɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">«Mɛnilu tɛrɛ tɛ n na jama ri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n di woilu kili n na jama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n tɛrɛ ma mɛn kanin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n di wo kili n kaninte.»<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />A sɛbɛnin ye ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">«A fɔra ii ma yɔrɔ mɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‹N na jama tɛ ai ri,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">ii tɔɔ ri bɔ ye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‹Alla Ɲenemaya la dencɛilu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.26</char> Hoseya suran 2 kuma diya 1 haan 3 ni suran 2 kuma diya 25</note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Esayi ka a kan nayɛlɛ Isirayɛli la ko rɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">«Hali Isirayɛli denniilu ye siyayala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">ikomin kiɲɛ mɛn ye kɔɔji dala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">ii to tɔnin de dɔrɔn di kisi.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Baa Maari ka a la kiti latɛɛninilu lakanbali dunuɲa lakaliya ko le ma ka a dafa!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.28</char> Esayi suran 10 kuma diya 22 haan 28</note><verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Esayi fɔlɔ ka ɲin fɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">«Na Maari Sebɛɛtii tɛrɛ ma an bɔnsɔn mɔɔ doilu to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">an tun da kɛ ikomin Sɔdɔmu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">an tun da kɛ ikomin Kɔmɔri.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.29</char> Esayi suran 1 kuma diya 9. A ragbɛ A Damira suran 19 kuma diya 23 haan 28 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛli Kibaro Ɲuma la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />An di nfen fɔ wo rɔ? Siya gbɛrɛ mɛnilu tɛrɛ tɛ telen ɲininna, woilu ra a sɔrɔn lemɛniya baraka rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Kɔni Isirayɛli mɛn tɛrɛ ye telenbaya ɲininna, telenbaya mɛn bɔnin sariya rɔ, woilu ti se a sɔrɔnna. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Wo di? Ka a masɔrɔn ii ma a ɲinin lemɛniya fɛ fɔɔ ii kɛwaliilu. Ii ka ii sennatu kaba la mɛn tɔɔ, «Sen natu kaba» <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Kitabu mɛn na ko fɔra ko, «A ragbɛ, n da kaba la Siyon, jama ye ii sennatula kabakudun mɛn na, kaba mɛn ye ii labela. Kɔni mɛn wa lemɛniya a ma, wo tii tɛ lamaloyala.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.33</char> Esayi suran 28 kuma diya 16</note><verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ n jusu bɛɛ rɔ, n wara mɔɔ Isirayɛlikailu ye kisi. N ye Alla matarala ii yɛ wo la kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Baa n tɛrɛ ye kɛla ii sere le ri ko Alla la ko kunfan ye ii la, kɔni ii ye lɔnbaliya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Alla ye mɔɔilu latelenna ɲa mɛn ma a jɛrɛ ɲakɔrɔ, ii ma wo lɔn. Wo rɔ, ii ra ii la ko ɲaɲinin ka kankan ii la telenbaya ma, ii ma kolo Alla la telenbaya kɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ka a masɔrɔn Ɲenematɔmɔnin da sariya lakanbali. Wo le rɔ, mɛn wa lemɛniya a ma, wo tii ra telen Alla ɲakɔrɔ.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kisi ko mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mɔɔilu ye telenbaya mɛn sɔrɔnna sariya rɔ, Musa ra wo ko sɛbɛ ko, «Mɛn wa sariya wo mira, wo tii ri to ɲenemaya rɔ ii fɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.5</char> Sarakalaselailu Suran 18 kuma diya 5</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Kɔni telenbaya mɛn ye sɔrɔnna Alla ɲakɔrɔ lemɛniya rɔ, wo sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ten de ko, «I kana a fɔ i jɛrɛ ma ko, ‹yon di se yɛlɛla harijeene rɔ?›» Wo kɔrɔ le, kosa a ye wa Ɲenematɔmɔnin najii. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />«Wala, ‹Yon di wa lakira?›» Wo kɔrɔ le, kosa a ri wa Ɲenematɔmɔnin nawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Kɔni a ka nfen fɔ? Ko, «Alla la kuma ye i tɔrɔfɛ, a ye i da rɔ, a ye i jusu rɔ,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.8</char> A ragbɛ Sariyailu suran 30 kuma diya 12 haan 14 kɔndɔ.</note> wo le lemɛniya kuma ri, an ye mɛn kawandila ten. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ni i ka i lɔ a la i da rɔ ko Isa le Maari ri, ka lemɛniya i jusu rɔ, ko Alla ka a lawuli le ka bɔ saya rɔ, i ri kisi. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Baa mɔɔ ye lemɛniyala a jusu le rɔ, wo rɔ Alla ye a latelenna a ɲakɔrɔ. I ye i lɔla a la i da rɔ, ka kisi. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ka a masɔrɔn Kitabu ka a fɔ ko, «Mɔɔ si wa lemɛniya a ma, wo tɛ lamaloyala.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.11</char> Esayi suran 28 kuma diya 16</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Baa dannafarabɔ tɛ Judiyailu ni siya gbɛrɛilu tɛma. Maari kelen pe le ii bɛɛ kun na mɛn ye mɔɔ bɛɛ sɔla a ɲumala mɛn ye a tɔɔ fɔla, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />baa Kitabu ka a fɔ ko, «Mɔɔ si wa Maari tɔɔ fɔ, wo ri kisi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.13</char> Jowɛli suran 3 kuma diya 5</note><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Kɔni ii ye a tɔɔ fɔla di, ni ii ma lemɛniya a ma? Ii ye lemɛniyala a ma di, ni ii ma a la ko lamɛn? Ii ye wo mɛnna di, ni mɔɔ ma kawandili kɛ ii yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Wo kawandili ye bɔla di, na keladenilu ma lawa? A sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ wo ɲa le ma ko, «Kibaro ɲuma laselailu na ko bɛnnin haan!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.15</char> Esayi suran 52 kuma diya 7</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Kɔni bɛɛ ma wo Kibaro Ɲuma mira. Baa, Esayi ka a fɔ le ko, «Maari, yon lanin an na kuma la?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.16</char> Esayi suran 53 kuma diya 1</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Wo rɔ, lemɛniya ye nala Alla la kuma mɛn fɛ. Alla la kuma fanan ye mɛnna Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko kawandili le fɛ.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Kɔni n ye ɲininkali kɛla: Ii ma a la ko mɛn wa? Ɛɛn, ii ra a mɛn! Kitabu ka a fɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">«Ii kumakan tun da wa duu fan bɛɛ rɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">Ii la kumailu wara haan dunuɲa danna.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.18</char> Yaburi suran 19 kuma diya 5</note><verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Awa, n ye ɲininkali kɛla ikɔ tuun, «Isirayɛlikailu ma a famun wa?» Musa le fɔlɔ ka ɲin fɔ ko, «N di ai keleya mɔɔilu fɛ siya bɛrɛ tɛ mɛnilu ri, ka ai lamɔnɛ siya hankilidɔɔ fɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.19</char> Sariyailu suran 32 kuma diya 21</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Esayi susura Alla la kuma ɲin fɔla ko, «Mɛnilu tɛrɛ tɛ n ɲininna, woilu ra n yen. Mɛnilu tɛrɛ tɛ ɲininkali kɛla n na ko rɔ, n da n jɛrɛ yiraka woilu la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.20</char> Esayi suran 65 kuma diya 1</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Kɔni a ka a fɔ Isirayɛli la ko rɔ ko, «N da n bolo rasɔmɔn jama kuma mirabali kɔnɔrɔgboilu ma telen gben!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.21</char> Esayi suran 65 kuma diya 2</note><verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Alla la kininkinin Isirayɛli ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />N ye ɲininkali ɲin kɛla: Alla ra a ban a la jama rɔ wa? Ɛɛn de! Ka a masɔrɔn Isirayɛlika le nde jɛrɛ ri, Iburahima bɔnsɔn do Bɛniyaminu kabila rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Alla tɛrɛ ma a la jama labila, a ka mɛn suwandi a jɛrɛ yɛ a damira. Eliya ye a dalakasila Alla yɛ Isirayɛlikailu la ko rɔ Kitabu kɔndɔ yɔrɔ mɛn, ai ma yɔrɔ wo lɔn wa? Ko, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />«Maari, ii ra i la kelalaselailu faa, ka i la saraka bɔ diyailu tiɲan, n kelen pe le tonin sisɛn, ii karannin n fanan faa ko rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.3</char> Mansailu Fɔlɔ Suran 19 kuma diya 10 ni suran 19 kuma diya 14</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Alla ka a jabi di? Ko, «N da mɔɔ waa wɔrɔnwula (7,000) lamara n jɛrɛ yɛ mɛnilu ma ii ɲɔnkinnin Bahali joo kɔrɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.4</char> Mansailu Fɔlɔ suran 19 kuma diya 18</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />A ye wo ɲa le ma ten, Alla la jama tɔ tonin mɛnilu suwandinin a la hina rɔ waati ɲin dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ni a kɛnin hina le rɔ, mɔɔilu kɛwali tɛ a ri butun. Ni wo tɛ Alla la hina tɛrɛ tɛ hina ri.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Nfen kɛnin wo rɔ? Isirayɛlikailu tɛrɛ ye mɛn ɲininna sɛbɛ rɔ, ii ma wo sɔrɔn. Kɔni fɔɔ Alla ka mɛnilu suwandi woilu le ka a sɔrɔn. A tɔilu jusu ragbɛlɛnyanin, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />ikomin a sɛbɛnin ɲa mɛn ma Kitabu rɔ ko, «Alla ra hankili gbo di ii ma, a ni ɲa mɛnilu tɛ fen yenna a ni tolo mɛnilu tɛ kuma mɛnna haan bi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.8</char> A ragbɛ Sariyailu suran 29 kuma diya 3 ni Esayi suran 6 kuma diya 10 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Dawuda ka a fɔ ko, «Alla ye ii la saliilu kɛ julu ri ii ɲɛrɔ a ni nɛɛ ɲankuma mɛn ye ii mirala, a ye a kɛ sennatufen di mɛn ye ii labela ka ii hakɛilu sara ii la. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ii ɲailu ye lafin, kosa ii ti se yennin kɛla! Ii kɔ mabirinnin ye to waati bɛɛ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.10</char> Yaburi suran 69 kuma diya 23 haan 24.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />N ye ai maɲininkala, Judiyailu filira waati mɛn na, ii bera le wa habadan? Ɛɛn de! Kɔni ii bera hakɛ le rɔ, baa siya gbɛrɛilu ka kisi ko sɔrɔn, kosa keleya ye Isirayɛlikailu mira. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Adon, ni Judiyailu hakɛ kɛra ɲaɲa ba ri dunuɲa mɔɔilu yɛ, ni ii la bɔnɔ kɛra ɲaɲa ri siya gbɛrɛilu yɛ, ii wa a lakanbali waati mɛn na, wo fanan tɛ ɲaɲa ba lana wo rɔ wa?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />N ye kumala aile siya gbɛrɛilu le yɛ ten. N da kɛ talibidenba ri siya gbɛrɛilu yɛ. N ye n wasola wo baara la, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />tumadɔ, n di keleya ladon n kabila mɔɔ rɔ kosa ii fanan doilu ye kisi. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Baa Isirayɛlikailu labilara waati mɛn na, ni Alla ni dunuɲa mɔɔilu tɛmala rabɛnda, nfen ye kɛla wo rɔ butun ni ii donda a la landaɲa rɔ ikɔ tuun? Wo ye kɛla wuli le ri ka bɔ saya rɔ ka wa ɲenemaya rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ni buru fɔlɔ lasera Alla ma, a ni mɛnilu gbasinin ii ɲɔɔn fɛ, woilu fanan sɛniman.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.16</char> A ragbɛ Jateilu suran 15 kuma diya 19 haan 21 kɔndɔ.</note> Ni jiri lulu sɛniman, a bolonilu fanan ye tola wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Kɔni ni a bolon doilu tɛɛra olibiye jiriju ma, ile siya gbɛrɛ mɛn kɛnin ikomin waa rɔ olibiyeju bolon, ka i sidi jiriju ma ii nɔ rɔ, ka to wo jiri lulu ji sɔrɔnna, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />i kana i jɛrɛ kɔrɔta wo jiri bolon tɛɛninilu ma. Ni i ka wo kɛ, i kana ɲina ko ile tɛ lulu balola de, lulu le ile balola.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Wo rɔ, ile ri a fɔ ko, «Jiri bolonilu tɛɛnin de kosa nde ye sidi ii nɔ rɔ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Tuɲa le wo ri, ii tɛɛnin ii la lemɛniyabaliya la ko le rɔ, i ye lɔla ii nɔ rɔ lemɛniya le rɔ. Wo rɔ, i kana i yanda wo ko rɔ de, kɔni i ye silan. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Baa, ni Alla ma Judiyailu lakandan, mɛnilu kɛnin ikomin jiri bolon fɔlɔilu, tumadɔ a ti nala i fanan nakandanna. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Wo rɔ, i ye i miri Alla la ɲumaya ni a la ɲakɔrɔ sidi ba ma. Mɛnilu filinin, a la ɲakɔrɔ sidi ba woilu ma, kɔni a la ɲumaya ka ɲin ile ma, kɔni fɔɔ i ye to a la ɲumaya rɔ, ni wo tɛ, a ri i fanan tɛɛ a jiriju ma ikomin jiri bolon. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ni Judiyailu ma to ii la lemɛniyabaliya rɔ, ii ri sidi ii lɔdiya ikɔ tuun, baa Alla ri se ii sidila ii nɔ rɔ ikɔ tuun. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Baa, ni ile siya gbɛrɛ kɛnin de ikomin waa rɔ olibiye jiri bolon mɛn tɛrɛ tɛɛnin a jiriju ma, ka i sidi so kɔndɔ olibiye jiri bɛrɛ ma hali i dan ɲa tɛrɛ tɛ a ri, wo rɔ Judiya jɛrɛ mɛnilu kɛnin ikomin so kɔndɔ olibiye jiri bɛrɛ bolonilu, Alla ri kaɲa woilu sidila ii jɛrɛ jiriju ma ii nɔilu rɔ fewu.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayɛli bɛɛ ri kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ ka Alla la gbundu ko ɲin yiraka ai la, kosa ai kana ai jɛrɛ jate lɔnninnailu ri: Isirayɛli jama fan kelen bannin Alla rɔ haan siya doilu kasabiya dafanin ye don. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Wo rɔ, Isirayɛli bɛɛ ri kisi ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">«Kunka ri bɔ Siyon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">a ri Alla lɔnbaliya bɛɛ bɔ Yakuba bɔnsɔn dɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />N wa ii julumun bɔ ii ma waati mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">n ye teriya sidila wo le fɛ ii yɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.27</char> Esayi suran 59 kuma diya 20 haan 21</note><verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ka bɛn Isa la Kibaro Ɲuma ma ii ra kɛ Alla juuilu ri aile le la ko kosɔn, kosa aile ri Isa la Kibaro Ɲuma sɔrɔn. Kɔni Alla diyanan jama suwandinin de ii ri ii benba kelalasela fɔlɔilu la ko rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ka a masɔrɔn Alla la sɔliilu ni a la kili tɛ mafalɔnna. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ikomin aile mɛn tɛrɛ ma Alla la kuma mira fɔlɔ, kɔni ai ra Alla la kininkinin sɔrɔn sinɛn Judiyailu la mirabaliya la ko kosɔn <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />wo ɲa ma, sinɛn Judiyailu tɛ Alla kan mirala butun kosa aile siya gbɛrɛilu ka kininkinin mɛn sɔrɔn, ii fanan ye wo sɔrɔn aile siya gbɛrɛilu sababu la. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Baa Alla ra mɔɔ bɛɛ kɛ kasola mɔɔilu ri ii la mirabaliya rɔ, kosa a ye kininkinin ii bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla ye tando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Alla la nɛma ni a la hankilimaya ni a la lɔnnin dun de wo ri! Yon di se Alla la ko latɛɛninilu famunna? Yon di se a la koilu famunna? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 11:34">«Yon ka Maari miriyailu lɔn? Yon di se kɛla a kawandi mɔɔ ri?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.34</char> Esayi suran 40 kuma diya 13</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Yon di se Alla julula, kosa a ye a lasɛ a ma ikɔ tuun?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.35</char> Juba suran 41 kuma diya 3</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Baa ko bɛɛ bɔnin ale bolo ale le baraka rɔ ale yɛ. Gbiliya ye ale le yɛ habadan. Amina!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔ ye baara Alla yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, Alla la kininkinin na ko kosɔn, n ye ai madiyala ai ye ai faribanku di Alla ma saraka ɲenemayanin di, mɛn sɛninyanin Alla yɛ, ka a hɛnɛ. Wo le kɛnin bato bɛrɛbɛrɛ ri ai ye mɛn kɛla Alla yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ai kana ai jɛrɛ bila dunuɲa koilu kɔfɛ, kɔni ai ye ai kɛɲa yɛlɛman hankilimaya kura rɔ, kosa ai ye Alla sawo fɛsɛfɛsɛ, a sawo mɛn ka ɲin, a ni mɛn duman, a ni mɛn dafanin.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />N wa a fɔ ai bɛɛ yɛ Alla la hina rɔ, a ka mɛn di n ma ko, ai kana a miri ai jɛrɛ la ko rɔ ka tamin doilu la, kɔni ai ye ai miri hankilimaya ni jɛrɛ mira rɔ ikomin Alla ka lemɛniya jate mɛn di ai ma. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />An fari yɔrɔilu siyayanin, kɔni ii bɛɛ ni ii baara. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />A ye wo ɲa le ma, hali an ka siya, an da kɛ faribanku kelen di Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, an di to an ɲɔɔn fɛ ikomin fari yɔrɔilu. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Alla ye an sɔla fen su siyaman de la, ikomin a ka latɛɛ an ma ɲa mɛn ma a la hina rɔ. Ni a ra mɔɔ sɔ nabiya kumailu rɔ, a ye wo labaara a la lemɛniya jate la. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ni baara le a ri jama yɛ, a ye baara kɛ. Ni karan de, a ye karan kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ni sɛɛbɛ donna le a ri, a ye ii sɛɛbɛ don. Ni sɔlila le a ri, a ye a kɛ fonesereya rɔ. Ni ɲɛmɔɔ le a ri, a ye wo kɛ kelen di. Ni kininkininna le a ri, a ye a kɛ sɛwa rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ai la kaninteya kana kɛ nafiya ri. Ai ye kojuu kɔn. Mɛn ka ɲin, ai ye wo mira gben! <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn kanin badenmaya kaninteya rɔ, ai ye to ai ɲɔɔn gbiliyala kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ai la tunadiya kana kɛ salaya ri. Kɔni ai ye baara Maari yɛ wakali ba rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ai ye sɛwa ai jii la ko rɔ, ka diɲɛ tɔrɔya rɔ, ka to Alla matarala waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ai ye mɔɔ sɛnimanilu donin ta ii makoilu rɔ. Ai ye kusanya mɔɔilu lamirala.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ai ye duwa ai bɛnsɛnkɔnintɛya mɔɔilu yɛ, ai ye duwa, ai kana danka kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Mɛnilu sɛwanin, ai ye sɛwa woilu fɛ. Mɛnilu ye kasila, ai ye kasi woilu fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ai kɔndɔ koilu ye kɛ kelen di ai ɲɔɔn yɛ. Ai kana ai waso, kɔni mɔɔ si majiinin ai ye wo madon ai la. Ai kana ai jɛrɛ jate lɔnninnailu ri.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ai kana kojuu sara kojuu la. Ai ye a kɛ koɲuma ka ko telennin kɛ mɔɔilu bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ni a ri bɛn, fanin wo faranin ai la, bɛn ye to ai ni mɔɔilu bɛɛ tɛma. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />N kaninteilu, ai kana ai ta sara, kɔni ai ye a to Alla la mɔnɛ ma, ka a masɔrɔn a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ, Maari ka a fɔ ko, «Nde le ta saralila ri. N di koilu sara ii ɲɔɔn na.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.19</char> Sariyailu suran 32 kuma diya 35</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Fɔɔ aile ye a kɛ wo ɲa ma: Kitabu ka a fɔ ko, «Ni kɔnkɔ ye i juu la, dɔɔnnifen di a ma; ni min lɔɔ ye a la, ji di a ma, ka a masɔrɔn ni i ka wo kɛ a yɛ, wo ye kɛla le a yɛ ikomin i ye ta kinbi le ladɛnna a kun ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.20</char> Sandailu suran 25 kuma diya 21 haan 22</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />I kana sɔn kojuu ye fanka sɔrɔn i ma, kɔni fɔɔ i ye se kojuu la koɲuma fɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">An ye kolo setiilu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ye kolo mansailu ma. Ka a masɔrɔn mansaya si tɛ ye, mɛn ma fara Alla la. Mansa mɛnilu siinin, ale le ka woilu sii. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Wo le rɔ, mɛn wa murunti mansailu ma, wo muruntinin Alla la fen suwandinin de ma. Mɛnilu wa a kɛ, woilu ri kiti lana ii jɛrɛ ma. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Koɲuma gbɛngbɛnna tɛ silanna mansailu ɲɛrɔ, kɔni fɔɔ kojuu kandanna. I ye a fɛ i kana silan mansa ɲɛrɔ wa? Wo rɔ, koɲuma kɛ kosa a ri i matɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Baa a kɛnin Alla la baaraden de ri kosa a ri koɲuma kɛ i yɛ. Kɔni ni i ka kojuu kɛ, silan a ɲɛrɔ! Baa fanmuru sa a bolo rakolon kan. Alla la baaraden de a ri mɛn ka a la mɔnɛ lajii kojuu kandanna ma, ka a la kojuu sara a la. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Wo le rɔ, fɔɔ ai ye kolo le mansailu ma, ko ii kana i ɲakankatan, wo tɛ gbansan, kɔni ka a la wo kan fanan kosa i kana i jɛrɛ jalaki i hankili rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Wo le rɔ, ai ye mudu sara, baa mɛnilu ye ii lamirala, woilu ye Alla la baarala le ri, mɛn ye a la mansaya baara kɛla. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ai ye mɔɔilu la juluilu sara. Ai ka kan ka mudu su su di, ai ye wo di. Ni ai bolofenilu mudu le a ri, ai ye wo di, ni gbiliya le a ri, ai ye wo di, ni kunnafulen de a ri, ai ye wo di.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mɔɔ si la julu kana to ai la, fɔɔ kaninteya ai ka kan ka mɛn namara ai ɲɔɔn yɛ. Mɛn wa a siiɲɔɔ kanin wo ra sariya dafa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Baa jamariilu ka a fɔ ko, «I kana kaninkɛ, i kana mɔɔ faa, i kana suɲali kɛ, i kana nata,» a ni jamarili tɔ bɛɛ kuma lasudunya rɔ, «I ye i mɔɔɲɔɔ kanin ikomin i jɛrɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.9</char> A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 20 kuma diya 13 haan 17 ni Sariyailu suran 5 kuma diya 17 haan 21 ni Sarakalaselailu suran 19 kuma diya 18 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Kaninteya tɛ sɔn kojuu ma i mɔɔɲɔɔ ma muumɛ! Kaninteya le sariya bɛɛ lakanbalila.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ai ye wo kɛ, baa ai ka waati ɲin lɔn. Waati ɲin da na ai la kunun diya sunɔɔ rɔ, baa an na kisi waati ra sudunya ka tamin an na lemɛniya damira waati la. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Su ra janfa, banda ka rasudunya. Wo rɔ, an di an ban ko woilu rɔ mɛnilu ye kɛla dibi rɔ, ka an masidi kɛnɛma kɛlɛkɛfenilu la. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />An ye taama ikomin mɛn dahanin, ikomin a bɛnnin kɛnɛ ma ɲa mɛn ma. An kana tolon haramunnin kɛ wala ka to an ɲa lamininna, an kana kaninkɛ wala ko haramunninilu, an kana bɛnbaliya wala keleya kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Fɔɔ ai ye Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta ikomin ai la duruki. Ai kana to ai mirila ai faribanku diyanan koilu kɛtailu ma.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">I kana i badenmailu jalaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mɔɔ mɛn na lemɛniya dɔɔman ai tɛma, ai ye wo ramira, ai kana ai miriyailu masɔsɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mɔɔ doilu ye fen bɛɛ dɔɔnna ii la lemɛniya rɔ, kɔni doilu ye nakɔfenilu le dɔrɔn dɔɔnna ii la lemɛniya fankatanya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Mɔɔ mɛn ye fen bɛɛ dɔɔnna, wo kana mɔɔ lagboyaɲɛ mɛn da a ban a rɔ. Mɛn ka a ban a rɔ, wo kana mɔɔ jalaki mɛn ye fen bɛɛ dɔɔnna, ka a masɔrɔn Alla ra a ramira. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Yon ye ile ri, ile mɛn ye mɔɔ gbɛrɛ la jɔn makitila? Ni a benin, wala ni a lɔnin, wo ye a tii le ma. Kɔni a ri lɔ ka a masɔrɔn Alla ri se a lalɔla.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mɔɔ doilu mirinin de, ko lon do taminnin lon do la. Gbɛrɛilu mirinin a ma, ko lon bɛɛ kelen. Fɔɔ bɛɛ ye la a miriya le la a ɲuma la. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Mɛn mirinin a ma, ko lon do taminnin lon do la, wo ye a kɛla Maari gbiliya ko le la. Mɛn ye fen bɛɛ dɔɔnna, wo fanan ye wo kɛla Maari gbiliya ko le la, baa a ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ wo dɔɔnnifen na ko rɔ. Mɛn wa a ban dɔɔnnifen do rɔ, wo ye wo kɛla Maari gbiliya ko le rɔ. Wo fanan ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Baa an foyi tɛ tola an nii la an jɛrɛ yɛ. An foyi tɛ faala an jɛrɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ni an tora an nii la, an tonin an nii la Maari le yɛ. Ni an faara, an faanin Maari le yɛ. Wo le rɔ, ni an tora an nii la, wala ni an faara, Maari le ta ye an di. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Wo le rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin faanin de, ka wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ kosa a ye kɛ mɔɔ faaniilu ni niilamailu Maari ri. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Kɔni ile, nfenna i ye i badenmailu jalakila? Nfenna i ye a dɔɔyala? Baa an bɛɛ ri an lɔ kitila diya Alla ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Baa a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">«Maari ka a fɔ ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">‹Alla Ɲenemaya le n di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">n da n kali n jɛrɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">kungbelen bɛɛ ri lajii n kɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">nɛn bɛɛ ri a lɔ Alla ma.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.11</char> Esayi suran 45 kuma diya 23</note>»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />An kelen kelenna bɛɛ ri a jɛrɛ dantɛ Alla yɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">I kana mɔɔilu lɔ hakɛla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Wo le rɔ, an ye fara an ɲɔɔn jalakila. Kɔni ai ye karan kosa ai kana foyi kɛ mɛn di ai badenma lafili wala ka a bila julumun dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Baa n ka a lɔn, ka a famun Maari Isa baraka rɔ ko dɔɔnnifen si haramunnin tɛ a jɛrɛ ma, kɔni ni mɔɔ ka a miri ko a haramunnin, wo rɔ a haramunnin ale yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ni i badenma tɔrɔnin i la dɔɔnnifen do la ko rɔ, i tɛ kaninteya sila kan butun. Ɲenematɔmɔnin faara mɔɔ mɛn na ko la, I kana wo halaki i la dɔɔnnifen na ko rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />I kana sɔn ko mɛn ka ɲin ile ma, wo ye kɛ koɲuma mafɔ kun di. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Baa Alla la mansaya kɛnin tɛ dɔɔnnifen ni minninfen de ri, kɔni fɔɔ telen ni jususuma ni sɛwa, ka fara Alla la Nii Sɛniman na, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />baa mɔɔ mɛnilu bɛɛ ye baarala Ɲenematɔmɔnin yɛ wo ɲa ma, woilu ri Alla hɛnɛ, mɔɔilu ri sɔn a ma.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Wo le rɔ, ko mɛnilu kɛnin jususuma ni an fanka don di an ma fɔɔ an ye woilu le kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />I kana Alla kɛwali tiɲan dɔɔnnifen fɛ. Dɔɔnninfen bɛɛ dɔɔn dahanin, kɔni a ma ɲin ka fen fen dɔɔn mɛn di badenma bila julumun dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />A ka fisa, i kana sobo dɔɔn, i kana rɛsɛnji min, i kana foyi kɛ ni a ri i badenma bila julumun dɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />I lanin mɛn na ko ɲinilu rɔ, wo mara i jɛrɛ yɛ Alla ɲakɔrɔ. Sɛwa ye wo tii yɛ mɛn tɛ a jɛrɛ jalakila a sɔn ko ma. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Kɔni ni mɛn ka dɔɔnnifen dɔɔn a sikanin mɛn dɔ, wo tii jalakinin de Alla bolo, ka a masɔrɔn a tɛ ko kɛla lemɛniya rɔ. Wo rɔ, ko si mɛn tɛ kɛla lemɛniya rɔ, julumun de wo ri.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">An ye misali ta Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Andeilu mɛnilu fanka ka bon lemɛniya rɔ, an ka kan ka diɲa woilu kɔrɔ fanka tɛ mɛnilu la lemɛniya rɔ. An kana an jɛrɛ diyanan ko kɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />fɔɔ an ye an mɔɔɲɔɔ diyanan ko le kɛ, ka ɲumaya a la, ka a lasabati lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɛ a diyanan koilu kɛla, kɔni ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «Ii ye i nanin mɛnilu kɛla, woilu ye sela nde le ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.3</char> Yaburi suran 69 kuma diya 10</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Baa mɛn bɛɛ sɛbɛnin waati taminniilu rɔ, woilu sɛbɛnin an karan ko le la kosa, tunadiya ni Kitabu la sɛɛbɛ don na ko kosɔn, an ye jii sɔrɔn. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Alla mɛn ye tunadiya ni sɛɛbɛ don dila, wo ye ai dɛmɛn, ai miriyailu ye kɛ kelen di ai ɲɔɔn yɛ, ka woilu bɛn Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa kɛɲa ma, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kosa ai ye Alla gbiliya miriya kelen ni kan kelen dɔ, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin fa.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kibaro Ɲuma Siyailu bɛɛ yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn damira Alla la gbiliya la ko rɔ, ikomin Ɲenematɔmɔnin ka ai ramira ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />N ye a fɔla ai yɛ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin da kɛ Judiyailu la baaraden di Alla la tuɲa la ko kosɔn, kosa Alla ka an benba kelalasela fɔlɔilu lahidi mɛn na, a ye wo fanka don, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kosa siya gbɛrɛilu fanan ye Alla gbiliya a la kininkinin na ko rɔ, ikomin a sɛbɛnin Kitabu kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma ko, «Wo le rɔ, n di i tando siyailu tɛma, ka i tɔɔ gbiliya kalaman dɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.9</char> Samuwɛla suran 22 kuma diya 50 ni Yaburi suran 18 kuma diya 50</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />A ka a fɔ fanan ko, «Siyailu, ai ni Alla la jama ye sɛwa ai ɲɔɔn fɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.10</char> Sariyailu suran 32 kuma diya 43</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />A ka a fɔ fanan ko, «Siyailu bɛɛ ye Maari tando! Jamailu bɛɛ ye a tando!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.11</char> Yaburi suran 117 kuma diya 1</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Awa, Esayi fanan ka a fɔ ko, «Jɛsɛ bɔnsɔn di wuli ikomin jiri lulu mɛn ye a matɛɛla, ka fanka sɔrɔn siyailu kun na. Siyailu ri ii jii la a rɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.12</char> Esayi suran 11 kuma diya 10</note><verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Nba, Alla mɛn ye jii tii ri, wo ye ai lafa sɛwa ni jususuma bɛɛ la ai la lemɛniya rɔ kosa ai jii ye to makafula Alla la Nii Sɛniman na fanka baraka rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la baara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />N badenmailu, nde jɛrɛ lanin a la ko ai fanin ɲumaya ni lɔnnin bɛɛ la, a ni ai ri se ai ɲɔɔn karanna. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Kɔni n da n jusulatɛɛ ka ko doilu sɛbɛ ai ma, kosa n ye a labila ai la Alla la hina la ko rɔ, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ko n ye kɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la baaraden di siya gbɛrɛilu yɛ. N ka kan ka baara ikomin sarakalasela mɛn ye Alla la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma lasela kosa, siya gbɛrɛilu ye kɛ saraka ɲuma ri Alla yɛ, ka lasɛninya Alla la Nii Sɛniman fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Wo rɔ, n di se n wasola Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa rɔ n na baara la ko rɔ Alla yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />N ti nala susu kuma si fɔla fɔɔ n ka mɛn kɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ, ka siya gbɛrɛilu kɛ Alla la kuma miralailu ri n kɛwaliilu ni n na kumailu fɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />a ni fanka tɔɔmasereilu ni kabannakoilu Alla la Nii Sɛniman fanka baraka rɔ. Wo le rɔ, ka damira Jerusalɛmu so ma haan ka wa sii Iliri jamana la,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.19</char> Iliri jamana ye Kirɛki jamana tele kankan bolo maran le ma.</note> n da Ɲenematɔmɔnin na Kibaro Ɲuma lase wo yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ haan ka dafa. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Wo rɔ, kunnafulen de wo ri nde yɛ, n ye Isa la Kibaro Ɲuma lasela wo yɔrɔilu rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko tɛrɛ ma lɔn yɔrɔ mɛnilu rɔ, kosa n kana bon lɔ mɔɔ gbɛrɛ la bon ju siinin kan. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />A sɛbɛnin Kitabu rɔ wo ɲa le ma ko, «A la ko tɛrɛ ma fɔ mɛnilu yɛ fɔlɔ, woilu ri a yen de. Mɛnilu tɛrɛ ma a la ko mɛn fɔlɔ, woilu ri a famun.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.21</char> Esayi suran 52 kuma diya 15</note><verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa lɔɔ ka Pɔli mira Romi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Wo le ka n wa ko tiɲan ai wara siɲa siyaman. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Kɔni sisɛn, n na baara ra ban jamana ɲinilu rɔ. Wo le rɔ, kɛbi san siyaman a lɔɔ ba tɛrɛ ye n na ka wa ai tuwa diya, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />n ka a miri n ye wo kɛ n wa kɛ wala Sapen jamana rɔ waati mɛn na. N tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka ai yen n wa kɛ taminna, ko ai ye n dɛmɛn n na taama rɔ, ka waatinin kɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ, ka wa wo jamana rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kɔni sisɛn, n ye wala Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ, ka wa jama sɛniman dɛmɛn ye. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Baa a ra Masedonikailu ni Akayakailu hɛnɛ, ii ye ii bolo ladɛn bolokolonilu la ko rɔ jama sɛniman tɛma Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />A ka ii hɛnɛ le ii ye wo kɛ, kɔni a tuɲa bolo ma julu ye ii la. Baa ni siya gbɛrɛilu ra Judiyailu la dina duwawuilu sɔrɔn, siya gbɛrɛilu fanan ka kan ka Judiyailu dɛmɛn ii bolofenilu la. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />N wa ban ko ɲin na waati mɛn na, ka a tɔnɔ don ii bolo, n di tamin ai wara n wa kɛ wala Sapen jamana rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />N ka a lɔn fewu, ko n wa kɛ wala ai wara waati mɛn na, n watɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na duwa dafanin de rɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />N badenmailu, n ye ai madiyala an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ a ni Alla la Nii Sɛniman na kaninteya rɔ, ai ye ai raja, ko an ye Alla matara n na ko rɔ kelen di. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ai ye Alla matara n yɛ kosa a ye n kunka Jude lemɛniyabaliilu ma, a ni n ye baara mɛn kɛla Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ, wo ye diya jama sɛniman yɛ ye. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Wo rɔ, ni Alla sɔnda, n di na sɛwa rɔ ai tɔrɔfɛ, an bɛɛ ri ɲɔɲɔli sɔrɔn an ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Jususuma Alla ye to ai bɛɛ fɛ. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli la foli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ai ye an badenma muso Febe jate mɔɔ ɲuma ri, mɛn ye baarala Sankere lemɛniya jama yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ai ye a ramira Maari tɔɔ rɔ ikomin a bɛnnin jama sɛniman tɛma ɲa mɛn ma, ai ye a dɛmɛn ɲa bɛɛ ma a mako wa kɛ a la yɔrɔ mɛn, baa ale jɛrɛ ra mɔɔ siyaman dɛmɛn a gbengben nde.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ai ye Pirisili ni Akila tuwa, n baaraden ɲɔɔnilu Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ii ra susu saya la nde nii la ko rɔ. N kelen tɛ baraka bilala ii yɛ, siya gbɛrɛ lemɛniya jamailu bɛɛ ye baraka bilala ii yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Lemɛniya jama mɛnilu ye ii ladɛnna ii la bon kɔndɔ, ai ye woilu fanan tuwa. Ai ye n kaninte Epayinɛte tuwa, mɛn fɔlɔ lemɛniyara Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma Asi jamana rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ai ye Mariyamu tuwa mɛn baaranin ai yɛ kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ai ye Andironiki ni Juniya tuwa n wara mɔɔilu, an ni mɛnilu bilara kaso la kelen di. Ii jatenin talibidenbailu tɛma. Ii fɔlɔ lemɛniyara Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma nde ko.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ai ye Anpiliyati tuwa n yɛ, n kaninte Maari rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ai ye Urubani tuwa n yɛ, an baaraden ɲɔɔn Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, a ni n kaninte Satakisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ai ye Apelɛsi tuwa mɛn ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta ri fɛsɛfɛsɛ rɔ. Ai ye Arisitobula la denbaya tuwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ai ye Herodiyon tuwa, n wara mɔɔ. Ai ye Narisisa la denbaya tuwa mɛnilu lanin Maari la.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ai ye Tirifina ni Tirifosa tuwa, muso mɛnilu ye baarala Maari yɛ haan! A ni n kaninte Pɛrasi muso gbɛrɛ mɛn baarara Maari yɛ kosɛbɛ! <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ai ye Rufusi tuwa, mɛn suwandinin Maari rɔ, a ni a na, mɛn kɛra ikomin n na. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ai ye Asinkirite ni Filekon ni Hɛrɛmɛ ni Patirobasi ni Herimasi tuwa a ni an badenma mɛnilu ye ii tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ai ye Filoloke ni Juliya tuwa a ni Nere ni a mamuso, a ni Olimipasi ni jama sɛniman mɛnilu bɛɛ ye ii tɔrɔfɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn tuwa badenmaya tuwali sunbuli rɔ. Ɲenematɔmɔnin na lemɛniya jamailu bɛɛ ye ai tuwala.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lalɔnnin tɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />N badenmailu, n ye ai madiyala, ai ye a kɛ ai hankili la mɔɔilu la ko rɔ mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu tɛmala farala, ka ii bila fili rɔ. Ai ka karan mɛn sɔrɔn, ii ye wo lalɔ. Ai ye ai mataa woilu la. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Baa wo mɔɔ suilu tɛ baarala an Maari Ɲenematɔmɔnin yɛ, kɔni ii jɛrɛ diyanan koilu! Sɔn tɛ mɔɔ mɛnilu la ii ye woilu majuuwayala ii la kuma ɲumailu ni ii la wuya matɔɔ kumailu la. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ra a mɛn ko ai ye Alla la kuma mirala. Wo rɔ, n sɛwanin ai la ko rɔ haan, kɔni n ye a fɛ le ai ye kɛ hankilimailu ri ka koɲuma lɔn, a ni sɛninyabatɔilu la kojuu kɛ la ko rɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Sinɛn jususuma Alla ri Setana ramɔɲɔnkɔ ai sen kɔrɔ. An Maari Isa ye hina ai la.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />N baaraden ɲɔɔn Timote ye ai tuwala a ni Lusiyusu ni Jasɔn ni Sosipateri, n wara mɔɔilu.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nde, Teritiyusi le ka bataki ɲin sɛbɛ Pɔli yɛ, n fanan da ai tuwa Maari tɔɔ rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.22</char> Teritiyusi le ka Pɔli kan sɛbɛ a yɛ. Tumadɔ a la baara le tɛrɛ kalata ri.</note><verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Kayusi ye ai tuwala, n londanyatii an ni lemɛniya jama bɛɛ. Erasite, so wodi lamarala a ni an badenma Kuwaratusi ye ai tuwala.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />An Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ai la. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alla matarali ni Alla tando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Alla mɛn di se ai fanka donna n na Kibaro Ɲuma lase fɛ, a ni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko kawandi lase fɛ, ka fara wo gbundu ko lɔnna mɛn doonnin tɛrɛ waati jan taminnin, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />mɛn da bɔ kɛnɛma sisɛn kelalaselailu la kitabuilu fɛ, ka fara Alla ɲenema la jamarili la ko la, a ye lasela siyailu bɛɛ ma, kosa a kan ye mira lemɛniya rɔ,<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Alla mɛn kelen pe ye lɔnninna ri, an ye wo Alla gbiliya Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ habadan! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>